"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m034-0211","start":211,"end":213,"surface":"仲由","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001297","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m034-0215","start":215,"end":219,"surface":"護駕乘車","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m034-0226","start":226,"end":229,"surface":"出公輒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001586","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p035","text":"仲由將入，遇子羔將出，曰：「門已閉矣。」子路曰：「吾姑至矣。」子羔曰：「不及，莫踐其難。」子路曰：「食焉不辟其難。」子羔遂出。子路入，及門，公孫敢闔門，曰：「毋入爲也！」子路曰：「是公孫也？求利而逃其難。由不然，利其祿，必救其患。」有使者出，子路乃得入。曰：「太子焉用孔悝？雖殺之，必或繼之。」且曰：「太子無勇。若燔臺，必舍孔叔。」太子聞之，懼，下石乞、盂黶敵子路，以戈撃之，割纓。子路曰：「君子死，冠不免。」結纓而死。孔子聞衞亂，曰：「嗟乎！柴也其來乎？由也其死矣。」孔悝竟立太子蒯聵，是爲莊公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m035-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"仲由","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001297","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m035-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"子羔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001593","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m035-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"子路","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001297","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m035-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"子羔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001593","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m035-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"子路","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001297","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m035-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"子羔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001593","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m035-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"子路","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001297","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-