"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m036-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"大臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m036-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p038","text":"三年，莊公上城，見戎州。曰：「戎虜何爲是？」戎州病之。十月，戎州告趙簡子，簡子圍衞。十一月，莊公出奔，衞人立公子斑師爲衞君。齊伐衞，虜斑師，更立公子起爲衞君。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001585","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"戎州","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"戎州","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"戎州","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"趙簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001585","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"衞人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0054","start":54,"end":58,"surface":"公子斑師","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001597","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"斑師","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001597","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0072","start":72,"end":75,"surface":"公子起","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001598","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p054","text":"司寇受封，梓材有作。成錫厥器，夷加其爵。暨武能脩，從文始約。詩美歸燕，傳矜石碏。皮冠射鴻，乘軒使穀。宣縱淫嬖，釁生伋、朔。蒯聵得罪，出公行惡。衞祚日衰，失於君角。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"成錫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"夷加","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"暨武","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"從文","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"石碏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001545","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"宣縱","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"伋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001553","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001557","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"蒯聵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001585","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"出公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001586","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"君角","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000540","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p054","text":"孔子曰：「魯衞之政，兄弟也。」是時，衞君輒父不得立，在外，諸侯數以為讓。而孔子弟子多仕於衞，衞君欲得孔子為政。子路曰：「衞君待子而為政，子將奚先？」孔子曰：「必也正名乎！」子路曰：「有是哉，子之迂也！何其正也？」孔子曰：「野哉由也！夫名不正則言不順，言不順則事不成，事不成則禮樂不興，禮樂不興則刑罰不中，刑罰不中則民無所錯手足矣。夫君子為之必可名，言之必可行。君子於其言，無所苟而已矣。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m054-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m054-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"衞君輒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002889","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m054-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002933","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m054-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m054-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、合稱、神怪或作品名待核；第60段文王是詩篇稱呼，不強接人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m054-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"衞君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002889","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m054-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m054-0055","st